      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is way better than them asking your age as soon as you get into a lobby, because newer players really don't know how to check group rules. Maybe like a toggle in group settings that allow to set age groups by 16+ or 18+ or even higher depending on the user's region",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
