  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-11-21T02:29:52.361Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be great to have an age verification feature for Group moderators to use for people entering a Group instance. The moderator can make a screen pop-up message that asks users if they are above the age of 18. The message only goes away when you press Yes to accept or No to decline using a checkmark. This feature is useful for Groups who do not want children in their instances.",
